         body='// Totp: HOTP with the time as counter (RFC 6238)\npublic static long counterAt(long unixSeconds) {\n    return unixSeconds / STEP_SECONDS;                 // 30 seconds\n}\n...\nreturn Hotp.code(key, counterAt(unixSeconds), DIGITS);  // 6 digits',
